```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Listening: Vol-Up Long Press / Voice Trigger
    Listening --> Navigating: Valid Destination Recognized
    Listening --> Idle: Timeout / User says "Cancel"

    Navigating --> Alerting: Obstacle / Hazard Detected
    Alerting --> Navigating: Hazard Cleared / Route Continues

    Navigating --> Paused: Vol-Down Tap / User Pause
    Paused --> Navigating: Resume Command

    Navigating --> Idle: Destination Reached / "Stop" Command

    Idle --> Error: Hardware / Permission Exception
    Navigating --> Error: Sensor / Vision Crash
    Error --> Idle: Auto-Recovery / Spoken Error

    Idle --> SafeMode: 3 Crashes in 5 Minutes
    Navigating --> SafeMode: 3 Crashes in 5 Minutes
    Error --> SafeMode: 3 Crashes in 5 Minutes
    SafeMode --> Idle: Manual Big Button Reset

    note right of SafeMode
        Camera OFF, Model OFF, Voice OFF.
        Tactile vibration + cane sensor only.
        Spoken: "Wayze is in safe mode. Use your cane."
    end note
```
